WEBVTT

00:02:59.963 --> 00:03:01.807
For most of human history,

00:03:01.807 --> 00:03:04.095
we could go no faster than a horse

00:03:04.095 --> 00:03:06.196
or a boat with a sail,

00:03:06.196 --> 00:03:08.597
but in 1969, the crew of Apollo 10

00:03:08.597 --> 00:03:12.480
flew at 25,000 miles an hour.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:15.380
Since 1970, no human beings

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.262
have been back to the moon.

00:03:17.262 --> 00:03:19.481
No one has traveled faster than the crew

00:03:19.481 --> 00:03:21.087
of Apollo 10,

00:03:21.087 --> 00:03:24.859
and blithe optimism about technology's powers

00:03:24.859 --> 00:03:26.761
has evaporated

00:03:26.761 --> 00:03:30.332
as big problems we had imagined technology would solve,